    "title": "Study Bible with explanation",
    "description": "Study Bible free, King James Version (KJV) with audio and 100% offline in English (US). Matthew Henry commentaries .\r\n\r\nStart you free Bible study today! Download Study Bible King James (KJV) with audio offline and explanation and have the best Study Bible on your phone.\r\n\r\nA KJV Study Bible free can help us to understand some difficult passages of the Bible. This app contains the most widely read Bible in the English language, King James Version offline with free Bible commentaries written by Matthew Henry, Welsh born minister and pastor and author of the Bible commentary Exposition of the Old and New Testament.\r\n\r\nHear, study and read the Holy Word at home, church or on the go!\r\n\r\nBEST FREE KJV BIBLE FOR ANDROID USERS\r\n\r\n- King James Study Bible with commentaries available for Android\r\n\r\n- Totally free\r\n\r\n- KJV Audio Bible to listen the Word in high quality audio\r\n\r\n- Use it offline: the King James Bible app works even without an internet connection\r\n\r\n- User-friendly interface\r\n\r\nINNOVATIVE FEATURES\r\n\r\n- Ability to easily search to any book, chapter or verse by keywords\r\n- Highlight whole verses in different customizable colors\r\n- You can even add dates\r\n- Make list of Favorites\r\n- Write notes while studying\r\n- Increase or decrease the size font\r\n- Ability to see the current verse of the book you were last reading\r\n- Protect your eyes with night mode by dimming the light when the environment is dark\r\n\r\nSHARE YOUR FAITH ON SOCIAL MEDIA\r\n\r\n- Share verses on social networks. Today a post made from your phone can reach the other side of the planet in seconds!\r\n\r\n- Convert Bible verses into photos to share and use on social networks\r\n- Send verses to family and friends by email, Messenger or WhatsApp\r\n- Receive inspirational verses every morning on your phone\r\n\r\n66 BOOKS TO CHOOSE FROM:\r\n\r\nOld Testament:\r\n\r\nGenesis, Exodus, Leviticus, Numbers, Deuteronomy, Joshua, Judges, Ruth, 1 Samuel, 2 Samuel, 1 Kings, 2 Kings, 1 Chronicles, 2 Chronicles, Ezra, Nehemiah, Esther, Job, Psalms, Proverbs, Ecclesiastes, Song of Solomon, Isaiah, Jeremiah, Lamentations, Ezekiel, Daniel, Hosea, Joel, Amos, Obadiah, Jonah, Micah, Nahum, Habakkuk, Zephaniah, Haggai, Zechariah, Malachi. \r\n\r\nNew Testament:\r\n\r\nMatthew, Mark, Luke, John, Acts, Romans, 1 Corinthians, 2 Corinthians, Galatians, Ephesians, Philippians, Colossians, 1 Thessalonians, 2 Thessalonians, 1 Timothy, 2 Timothy, Titus, Philemon, Hebrews, James, 1 Peter, 2 Peter, 1 John, 2 John, 3 John, Jude, Revelation.",
